  "fixes": [
    "Civ8 AI census covers DEFS.len; can_train filters before reservoir RNG.",
    "PKW version3 retains96 ordered own navigation fields, budget/version/LRU and all actual actor flow slots in NVC1.",
    "Separate PRJ1 retains ordered complete in-flight projectile launch snapshots and damage/targets; stale target generations remain valid.",
    "Authoritative population/capacity/building counts update at mutation/tick boundaries, never in ui/save/hash. Unfinished buildings give no cap.",
    "Global alive refresh is independent of local winner latch.",
    "HSH3 covers future-read semantic actor/player/map state while excluding selection, interpolation, local outcome and transport.",
    "combat_stat accepts all80 source definitions for Civ8 only; query remains readonly."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Own map/pathfinder, AI policy, movement, clock and projectile simulation remain named adapters; no native EE2 AI/save/physics parity claim.",
    "Known historical flat5/6/7/8 and PKWv1/v2 never stored some route/projectile/allocator history. Missing history is explicit; lost historical flight damage or route state is not invented.",
    "Local outcome latch, benchmark mode, presentation-only FX/sounds and local selection are outside gameplay save/hash contracts.",
    "Regional/gender graphics, complete native world/map integration and remaining ability/event/visual gaps are separate work; this is not complete original1:1 reconstruction.",
    "Feature-disabled binaries may differ in compiler/panic metadata; actual unchangedOwn0/Base1/Joint7 behavior and serialized bytes were compared over10926 checks."
  ],
